<title>USA: SoftNet to develop Motorola intranets.</title>
<headline>SoftNet to develop Motorola intranets.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoftNet Systems Inc said Friday its Business Solution Division was selected by Motorola Inc's Automotive, Energy and Components Sector to develop intranet applications for various business programs.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>SoftNet provides electronic information and document management systems.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
